": "8.png", "id": "485635779381042", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036615_485635782714375_1385063564147581312_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZEao-kKUTgsQ7kNvwEq_FS9&_nc_oc=Adprf-CMb1f09UsR9qCRSOp-8CIhGtMEFwVixUN4tDhMjx_VrRVSHEB8AIw8ylMy-so&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1a4SS3HA__UhgQsvSXSdBpfGhcVnwiVNwrawa17p3y6w&oe=69F4B75A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "284612080076581", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974910_284612083409914_181064660682537571_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OX_t3EJjkXAQ7kNvwFF52fA&_nc_oc=Ado80DMc9vc3wVbdMiN_tZC_H0DrIv9YQ_VMGLgx-t-S2PZfSTtAvdSvp6o83C27Owk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af2fpC5whwcneIX5J3t74sB-wdNQPL_Dqi2zwr2lQlE1Xg&oe=69F4BE34"}, "display_name": "Wack-Ammo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You are armed with a Wack-A-Mole game and a gun to eliminate your targets in each new gallery.  The trick is, you must keep playing Wack-A-Mole to keep your gun loaded.  \n\nEach level ups the challenge and keeps you on your toes.  Take your eyes of the board and it could end it all.  \n\nWack-Ammo is a fun throwback to the old light gun games of the 8 bit era. The hand drawn 2D graphics put you inside these classic shooters with the added flare of VR.\n\n* 9 Unique Levels \n* Different Guns & Wackers Each Gallery\n* Unlock Badges For Your \"Wall Of Achievement\" With Each Victory\n*Earned Trophies Come To Life In Your Home Gallery\n\nWack-Ammo is a must play for every Quest owner.", "short_description": "You are armed with a Wack-A-Mole game and a gun to eliminate your targets in each new gallery.  The trick is, you must keep playing Wack-A-Mole to keep your gun loaded.  \n\nEach level ups the challenge and keeps you on your toes.  Take your eyes of the board and it could end it all.  \n\nWack-Ammo is a fun throwba